<mxfile host="127.0.0.1"><diagram name="Interfaces — IN / OUT" id="gPru4ZMKnug53dI9Kuhv"><mxGraphModel dx="1414" dy="798" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" value="MEOGAP — Interface contracts: inputs and outputs" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="34" width="1780" x="40" y="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#555555;" value="One card per interface family, grouped by owner. IN = conceptual request information, OUT = conceptual response information. Response-only IDs (UI-16..22, UI-24) are folded into the OUT side of their request." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="22" width="1780" x="40" y="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1f6feb;strokeColor=#1f6feb;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=middle;" value="GAT — public REST owner&lt;br&gt;&lt;font size='1'&gt;consumer: UI · UI-01..UI-24&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="46" width="420" x="40" y="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2e7d32;strokeColor=#2e7d32;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=middle;" value="CON — lifecycle, credits, delivery consumer: GAT · GC-02..GC-09, GC-14" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="46" width="420" x="490" y="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-5" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b26a00;strokeColor=#b26a00;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=middle;" value="SCI — scientific authority&lt;br&gt;&lt;font size='1'&gt;consumers: CON, GAT · CS-01..CS-08, GS-01/02&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="46" width="420" x="940" y="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-6" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#6a3fb5;strokeColor=#6a3fb5;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=middle;" value="CAT — assets, metadata, lineage&lt;br&gt;&lt;font size='1'&gt;consumers: CON, SCI · CC-01..CC-14, SC-01..SC-04&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="46" width="420" x="1390" y="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-7" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f8fbff;strokeColor=#9dbfee;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#1f6feb'&gt;&lt;b&gt;UI-01&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Browse product catalogue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;UI → GAT&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Optional filters and pagination; caller context derived by GAT.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Product IDs, names, descriptions, requestability info." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="40" y="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-8" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f8fbff;strokeColor=#9dbfee;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#1f6feb'&gt;&lt;b&gt;UI-02&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Retrieve product definition&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;UI → GAT&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Product identifier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Purpose, method, parameters, outputs, units, assumptions, limitations and validation status." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="40" y="246" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-9" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f8fbff;strokeColor=#9dbfee;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;UI-05 · Async&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Submit analysis request UI → GAT → CON&lt;br&gt;IN Product ID, AOI/POI/LOI, buffer, UTC temporal scope, product parameters.&lt;br&gt;OUT Persistent request ID + PREPARING state; UI-17 proposal later." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="40" y="332" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-10" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f8fbff;strokeColor=#9dbfee;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#1f6feb'&gt;&lt;b&gt;UI-06&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Confirm proposed request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;UI → GAT → CON&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Request identifier and explicit confirmation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Admission outcome and current request state." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="40" y="418" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-11" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f8fbff;strokeColor=#9dbfee;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#1f6feb'&gt;&lt;b&gt;UI-07&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;List analysis requests&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;UI → GAT → CON&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Optional filters, sorting and pagination.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Caller's requests: IDs, summary, timestamps, lifecycle state." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="40" y="504" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-12" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f8fbff;strokeColor=#9dbfee;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#1f6feb'&gt;&lt;b&gt;UI-08&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Retrieve request status&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;UI → GAT → CON&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Request identifier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Authoritative proposal/execution state and user-visible status details." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="40" y="590" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-13" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f8fbff;strokeColor=#9dbfee;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#1f6feb'&gt;&lt;b&gt;UI-09&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Request map visualization&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;UI → GAT → CON → SCI&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Result ID and supported map/display selection.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Map representation or access reference, with extent, CRS and validity metadata." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="40" y="676" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-14" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f8fbff;strokeColor=#9dbfee;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#1f6feb'&gt;&lt;b&gt;UI-10&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Request analytical representation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;UI → GAT → CON → SCI&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Result ID, spatial selection (point or zonal/AOI), temporal window, representation options.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Values, time coordinates, units, spatial support, quality and missing/masked distinctions." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="40" y="762" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-15" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f8fbff;strokeColor=#9dbfee;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#1f6feb'&gt;&lt;b&gt;UI-11&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Inspect scientific input requirements&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;UI → GAT ↔ SCI&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Product identifier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Abstract bands/variables, spatial/spectral resolution, period constraints, quality criteria." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="40" y="848" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-16" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f8fbff;strokeColor=#9dbfee;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#1f6feb'&gt;&lt;b&gt;UI-12&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Inspect actual result lineage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;UI → GAT → CON → CAT&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Result identifier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Actual source/intermediate assets, versions used, registered lineage and asset metadata." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="40" y="934" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-17" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f8fbff;strokeColor=#9dbfee;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;UI-13 · Async / UI-21 outcome&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Download final product UI → GAT → CON&lt;br&gt;IN Result ID and optional format selection.&lt;br&gt;OUT Delivery ID + initial state; later status and secure access through same delivery resource." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="40" y="1020" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-18" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f8fbff;strokeColor=#9dbfee;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;UI-14 · Async / UI-21 outcome&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Request dependency archive UI → GAT → CON&lt;br&gt;IN Result ID and optional archive options.&lt;br&gt;OUT Delivery ID + initial state; later status and secure access through same delivery resource." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="40" y="1106" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-19" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f8fbff;strokeColor=#9dbfee;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#1f6feb'&gt;&lt;b&gt;UI-15&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Retrieve credit balance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;UI → GAT → CON&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Authenticated caller context only.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Current balance." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="40" y="1192" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-20" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f8fbff;strokeColor=#9dbfee;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#1f6feb'&gt;&lt;b&gt;UI-23&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Request analysis cancellation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;UI → GAT → CON&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Request ID and cancellation intent.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Cancellation outcome and current request state." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="40" y="1278" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-21" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f7fbf5;strokeColor=#a9cfa0;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;GC-02 / -R · Async&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Create request &amp;amp; prepare proposal GAT → CON&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt; Product ID, scope, parameters, trusted caller/correlation context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt; Persistent Request ID + PREPARING state; proposal or infeasibility outcome later." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="490" y="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-22" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f7fbf5;strokeColor=#a9cfa0;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;GC-03&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Confirm proposal &amp;amp; launch computation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;GAT → CON&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Request ID, explicit confirmation, trusted caller context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Accepted/rejected, current state, execution-start outcome." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="490" y="246" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-23" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f7fbf5;strokeColor=#a9cfa0;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;GC-04 / -R&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;List requests&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;GAT → CON&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Trusted caller context, optional filters and pagination.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Requests owned/visible to the caller, with summaries and current states." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="490" y="332" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-24" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f7fbf5;strokeColor=#a9cfa0;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;GC-05 / -R&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Retrieve request status&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;GAT → CON&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Request ID and trusted caller context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Authoritative request/proposal/execution/cancellation state." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="490" y="418" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-25" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f7fbf5;strokeColor=#a9cfa0;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;GC-06 / -R&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Retrieve credit balance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;GAT → CON&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Trusted caller context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Current balance and relevant accounting/consistency information." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="490" y="504" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-26" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f7fbf5;strokeColor=#a9cfa0;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;GC-07 / -R&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Decide access to result/resource&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;GAT → CON&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Caller context, target result/resource ID, requested action (map, series, lineage, download).&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Allow/deny and a reason/category where needed." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="490" y="590" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-27" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f7fbf5;strokeColor=#a9cfa0;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;GC-08 · Async&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Request final-product delivery GAT → CON&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt; Result ID, optional format, trusted caller context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt; Delivery ID + initial state; UI-21 later exposes state and secure access." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="490" y="676" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-28" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f7fbf5;strokeColor=#a9cfa0;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;GC-09 · Async&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Request dependency archive GAT → CON&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt; Result ID, optional archive options, trusted caller context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt; Delivery ID + initial state; UI-21 later exposes state and secure access." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="490" y="762" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-31" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#f7fbf5;strokeColor=#a9cfa0;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;GC-14 / -R&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Request cancellation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;GAT → CON&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Request ID and trusted caller context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Cancellation outcome and current state." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="490" y="848" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-32" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fffcf7;strokeColor=#e0b877;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#b26a00'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CS-01 / CS-02 · Async&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Feasibility &amp;amp; abstract requirements CON → SCI&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt; Product ID, parameters, spatial/temporal scope, request context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt; Feasibility, constraints, infeasibility reasons, abstract input requirements." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="940" y="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-33" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fffcf7;strokeColor=#e0b877;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#b26a00'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CS-03 / CS-04 · Async&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Computation-complexity estimate CON → SCI&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt; Product ID, parameters, spatial/temporal scope, computation options, context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt; Complexity/resource estimate, volume/effort, indicative duration, assumptions." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="940" y="246" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-34" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fffcf7;strokeColor=#e0b877;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#b26a00'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CS-05 / CS-06&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Execute product computation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;CON → SCI · async&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Product ID, version context, parameters, scope, concrete input asset references, execution context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Outcome, result metadata, method/version, consumed inputs, quality/coverage, diagnostics, registration outcome." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="102" width="420" x="940" y="332" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-35" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fffcf7;strokeColor=#e0b877;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#b26a00'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CS-07 / CS-08&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Harmonize L0 Source representation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;CON → SCI · async&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Source Asset ID, original representation reference, harmonization options, processing context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Outcome, representation metadata, method/provenance, quality, CAT registration status." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="940" y="444" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-36" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fffcf7;strokeColor=#e0b877;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#b26a00'&gt;&lt;b&gt;GS-01 / GS-02&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Scientific product catalogue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;GAT → SCI&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Product ID, or catalogue filters and pagination.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; IDs, definitions, parameters, scientific characteristics, input requirements, docs/validation metadata." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="89" width="420" x="940" y="530" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-37" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fbf9ff;strokeColor=#c3b0e6;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#6a3fb5'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CC-01 / CC-02 · Async&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Resolve abstract requirements CON → CAT&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt; SCI criteria, spatial/temporal scope, compatibility/quality constraints, context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt; Concrete assets, support, quality/coverage and representation availability; includes missing-item details." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="89" width="420" x="1390" y="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-38" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fbf9ff;strokeColor=#c3b0e6;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#6a3fb5'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CC-03 · Async outcome detail&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Report missing intermediate products CAT → CON&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt; No separate request; included in CC-01/02 outcome.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt; Missing product identity, required scope/parameters and dependency context." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="1390" y="259" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-39" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fbf9ff;strokeColor=#c3b0e6;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#6a3fb5'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CC-04 · Async outcome detail&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Report missing L0 acquisitions CAT → CON&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt; No separate request; included in CC-01/02 outcome.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt; Missing acquisition identity/provider, tile/acquisition context and constraints." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="1390" y="345" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-40" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fbf9ff;strokeColor=#c3b0e6;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#6a3fb5'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CC-05 / CC-06 · Async&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Itemized L0 acquisition costs CON → CAT&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt; List of missing source acquisitions and provider context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt; Cost per acquisition, cost unit and assumptions/limitations." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="1390" y="431" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-41" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fbf9ff;strokeColor=#c3b0e6;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#6a3fb5'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CC-07 / CC-08&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;L0 ingestion&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;CON → CAT · async&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Acquisition IDs, provider references, ingestion context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Outcome, registered Source Asset IDs, original representation metadata, diagnostics." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="1390" y="517" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-42" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fbf9ff;strokeColor=#c3b0e6;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#6a3fb5'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CC-09 / CC-10&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Resolve canonical refs &amp;amp; locations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;CON → CAT&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Logical asset/representation identifiers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Canonical references, current locations, metadata needed for processing/delivery." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="1390" y="603" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-43" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fbf9ff;strokeColor=#c3b0e6;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#6a3fb5'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CC-11 / CC-12&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Actual result lineage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;CON → CAT&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Result/Derived Asset identifier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Exact consumed source/intermediate assets, relationships, registered metadata." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="1390" y="689" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-44" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fbf9ff;strokeColor=#c3b0e6;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#6a3fb5'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CC-13&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Resolve original Source representation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;CON → CAT&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Source Asset ID and original-provider representation selection/context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Original representation reference/location and associated metadata." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="1390" y="775" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-45" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fbf9ff;strokeColor=#c3b0e6;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#6a3fb5'&gt;&lt;b&gt;CC-14&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Harmonized representation availability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;CON → CAT&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Source Asset ID and required representation characteristics/identifiers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Availability state per representation, plus metadata/location where available." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="1390" y="861" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-46" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fbf9ff;strokeColor=#c3b0e6;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#6a3fb5'&gt;&lt;b&gt;SC-01 / SC-02&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Register Derived Asset&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;SCI → CAT&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Output metadata, object ref, product ID, method/version, scope, quality, exact consumed inputs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Registration outcome, canonical logical asset ID, diagnostics." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="1390" y="947" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-47" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fbf9ff;strokeColor=#c3b0e6;fontSize=9;" value="&lt;font color='#6a3fb5'&gt;&lt;b&gt;SC-03 / SC-04&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;Register harmonized representations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#8a8a8a'&gt;SCI → CAT&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#1565c0'&gt;&lt;b&gt;IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Source Asset ID, representation metadata, object ref, harmonization method/version, quality.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#2e7d32'&gt;&lt;b&gt;OUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Registration outcome, representation identifiers, diagnostics." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="76" width="420" x="1390" y="1033" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-48" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#dddddd;fontSize=9;fontColor=#555555;" value="&lt;b&gt;Async&lt;/b&gt; — proposal preparation (UI-05/GC-02), CS-01..CS-08, CC-01..CC-08 and delivery (UI-13/14, GC-08/09/UI-21) all produce later correlated outcomes. &lt;b&gt;Sync&lt;/b&gt; — confirmation, short reads, authorization, CAT reference/lineage lookups and SCI→CAT registration. No conditional mode. GC-10..GC-13 are removed. No GAT↔CAT, UI↔internal components or SCI→CAT input-resolution interface." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="70" width="1780" x="40" y="1350" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-49" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#b0b0b0;dashed=1;fontSize=8;fontColor=#5a5a5a;" value="&lt;b&gt;Credit integrity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Balance is checked and debited atomically at synchronous confirmation (GC-03). A proposal is never a reservation." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="89" width="420" x="490" y="950" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-50" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#b0b0b0;dashed=1;fontSize=8;fontColor=#5a5a5a;" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading this column&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CS-01..CS-08 are asynchronous proposal/execution/harmonization interactions. GS-01/GS-02 is synchronous catalogue access. SCI never resolves concrete inputs; references arrive from CON (CC-*)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="102" width="420" x="940" y="629" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jAB0ceyd5Q7n2cgMFldZ-51" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=7;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#b0b0b0;dashed=1;fontSize=8;fontColor=#5a5a5a;" value="&lt;b&gt;Authority, not storage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;CAT owns asset metadata and canonical references. It returns locations, never raw files; physical storage stays an infrastructure concern." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="102" width="420" x="1390" y="1119" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>